	\L_02c95:
	\L_02bed:
	ZH 1:
	'No, but related to that...'
	\L_02ca2:
	ZH 1:
	'I can’t accept my army losing'
	R
	'to that redwood-sized demon,'
	R
	'Babolat.'
	\L_02ca2:
	ZH 1:
