	R
	'Go away.'
	\L_02ca2:
	\L_02c95:
	\L_02bed:
	ZH 1:
	'...King Rance, I’m still in'
	R
	'service... Have me fight'
	R
	'more...'
	\L_02ca2:
	\L_02c95:
	\L_02b7d:
	ZH 1:
	'Dump him in the courtyard or'
	R
	'something.'
	\L_02ca2:
	\L_02c95:
	\L_02bb5:
	ZH 1:
	'At Rance’s order, some'
	R
	'soldiers came out from behind'
	R
	'a curtain.'
